# Claude's model host. The login hosts are in claude-login.hosts (read beside this list in every
# shape); telemetry hosts are deliberately absent (Sentry, Statsig;
# CLAUDE_CODE_DISABLE_NONESSENTIAL_TRAFFIC=1 in run.sh stops it trying). In the gateway shape with
# gateway.model true this list is not read: the model goes through the gateway's anthropic subdomain.
api.anthropic.com     # the Claude model API
